OL,3,GNEWSAGhosts fans make 'dream'
OL,4,Apilgrimage to sitcom set
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of Ghosts superfans from Sweden
OL,7,Fhave visited the stately home where the
OL,8,FBBC sitcom was filmed, describing it as
OL,9,F"a dream come true".
OL,11,FThe five friends made the trip to West
OL,12,FHorsley Place - the Surrey manor house
OL,13,Fwhere the programme is set - ahead of
OL,14,Fan upcoming film adaptation, before
OL,15,Fattending the movie's premiere in
OL,16,FLondon.
OL,18,FAmanda Helmfrid, dressed as character
OL,19,FAlison Cooper, said it was "kind of
OL,20,Fsurreal" to visit the property, known
OL,21,Fas Button House in the programme.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
